# ${project_name}

${project_description}

ArgoCD-managed Kubernetes manifests for the homelab cluster.

## Layout

```
apps/<group>/<app>/                # per-app kustomization (with helmCharts)
apps/<group>/application-set.yaml  # ApplicationSet for the group
infra/<group>/<app>/               # cluster-level infrastructure
```

## Conventions

- Kustomize `helmCharts` for chart-based deploys; raw manifests otherwise.
- OCI chart URLs as `oci://...` WITHOUT the chart name suffix (kustomize
  appends it).
- ApplicationSets use `goTemplate: true` and `.path.basename`.
- Image pinning + `# renovate: image=<repo>` comments on the line above
  each tag.

See `docs/` for the full convention reference.
